ap Nabi SAW). Lalu Nabi SAW memerintahkan terhadap \nmereka, maka mereka dipotong tangan dan kaki mereka serta mata mereka dipaku. \nKemudian mereka dipanaskan di terik matahari hingga mati</i><i><span>�</span>.</i> [HR. Muslim juz 3, hal 1296]</p>\n<p dir=\"rtl\"><span lang=\"AR-SA\">����</span><span lang=\"AR-SA\"> </span><span lang=\"AR-SA\">���������</span><span lang=\"AR-SA\"> </span><span lang=\"AR-SA\">�����</span><span lang=\"AR-SA\"> </span><span lang=\"AR-SA\">�������</span><span lang=\"AR-SA\"> </span><span lang=\"AR-SA\">��</span><span lang=\"AR-SA\"> </span><span lang=\"AR-SA\">�����������</span><span lang=\"AR-SA\"> </span><span lang=\"AR-SA\">�����</span><span lang=\"AR-SA\"> </span><span lang=\"AR-SA\">������</span><span lang=\"AR-SA\"> </span><span lang=\"AR-SA\">����</span><span lang=\"AR-SA\"> </span><span lang=\"AR-SA\">������</span><span lang=\"AR-SA\"> </span><span lang=\"AR-SA\">��</span><span lang=\"AR-SA\"> </span><span lang=\"AR-SA\">����������</span><span lang=\"AR-SA\"> </span><span lang=\"AR-SA\">��������</span><span lang=\"AR-SA\"> </span><span lang=\"AR-SA\">�������������</span><span lang=\"AR-SA\"> </span><span lang=\"AR-SA\">�����</span><span lang=\"AR-SA\"> </span><span lang=\"AR-SA\">���������</span><span lang=\"AR-SA\"> </span><span lang=\"AR-SA\">�</span><span lang=\"AR-SA\"> </span><span lang=\"AR-SA\">��</span><span lang=\"AR-SA\"> </span><span lang=\"AR-SA\">������������</span><span lang=\"AR-SA\"> </span><span lang=\"AR-SA\">���������������</span><span lang=\"AR-SA\"> </span><span lang=\"AR-SA\">������</span><span lang=\"AR-SA\">: </span><span lang=\"AR-SA\">���</span><span lang=\"AR-SA\"> </span><span lang=\"AR-SA\">�������</span><span lang=\"AR-SA\"> </span><span lang=\"AR-SA\">������</span><span lang=\"AR-SA\"> </span><span lang=\"AR-SA\">������</span><span lang=\"AR-SA\"> </span><span lang=\"AR-SA\">������</span><span lang=\"AR-SA\"> </span><span lang=\"AR-SA\">������</span><span lang=\"AR-SA\"> </span><span lang=\"AR-SA\